                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Replication data for Chapter 4: The chapter uses municipal level data (1101 municipalities) from the Colombian National Department of Planning (DNP), the National Register Office, and the Center for Economic Development Studies (CEDE), between 2002 and 2017. To analyse the data, municipal fixed effects (FE) were used and a difference-in-difference model approach. Robustness tests were conducted using additional data."
